# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# THE ICONS ARE IMMUTABLE AND THE PAGE IS NOT. Every file under /icons/ is
# content-addressed by hand - its bytes change only when the brand does, and
# then it gets reviewed - so a year is a safe max-age. index.html must stay
# short, or a splash edit takes a week to reach anybody who has been here.
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
